    "q-138791": {
      "dom_id": "step-q138791",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Consider the function $y={x}^{5{x}^{2}-2}.$ Its derivative is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={x}^{5{x}^{2}-3}\\cdot g(x).\n$$\n\nFind the function $g(x).$",
      "worked_solution": "We have the function \n\n$$\ny={x}^{5{x}^{2}-2}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we take the natural logarithm of both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{5{x}^{2}-2}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =(5{x}^{2}-2)\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we differentiate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡y) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}((5{x}^{2}-2)\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{x}^{2}-2)\\cdot (\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)+(5{x}^{2}-2)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =10x\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡x+(5{x}^{2}-2)\\cdot \\frac{1}{x} \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =10x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+\\frac{5{x}^{2}-2}{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve for $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y(\\frac{5{x}^{2}-2}{x}+10x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $y={x}^{5{x}^{2}-2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={x}^{5{x}^{2}-2}(\\frac{5{x}^{2}-2}{x}+10x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & ={x}^{5{x}^{2}-2}(\\frac{5{x}^{2}-2}{x}+\\frac{10{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{x}) \\\\  & ={x}^{5{x}^{2}-3}(5{x}^{2}+10{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $g(x)=5{x}^{2}+10{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-2.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-138791-a",
