    "q-138840": {
      "dom_id": "step-q138840",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "Consider the function $y=({x}^{2}+3x)^{x}.$ Its derivative is given by \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=({x}^{2}+3x)^{x-1}\\cdot g(x).\n$$\n\nFind the function $g(x).$",
      "worked_solution": "We have the function \n\n$$\ny=({x}^{2}+3x)^{x}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we take the natural logarithm of both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(({x}^{2}+3x)^{x}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we differentiate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡y) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)\\cdot (\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x))+(x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =1\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)+x\\cdot (\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+3x}\\cdot 2x+3) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)+\\frac{2{x}^{2}+3x}{{x}^{2}+3x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve for $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)+\\frac{2{x}^{2}+3x}{{x}^{2}+3x})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $y=({x}^{2}+3x)^{x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =({x}^{2}+3x)^{x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)+\\frac{2{x}^{2}+3x}{{x}^{2}+3x}) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}+3x)^{x}(\\frac{({x}^{2}+3x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)}{{x}^{2}+3x}+\\frac{2{x}^{2}+3x}{{x}^{2}+3x}) \\\\  & =({x}^{2}+3x)^{x-1}(({x}^{2}+3x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)+(2{x}^{2}+3x)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, $g(x)=({x}^{2}+3x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+3x)+(2{x}^{2}+3x).$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-138840-a",
